...@../../_tools/theme
direction: down

project_coordinator: 3. 프로젝트 코디네이터 (ProjectCoordinator) { class: ours }
gen_tool: 렌더링 생성 도구 (generate_renovation_rendering) { class: ours }
edit_tool: 렌더링 편집 도구 (edit_renovation_rendering) { class: ours }
flash: gemini-3-flash-preview { class: ext }

project_coordinator -> flash: instruction + 렌더링 도구 선언
project_coordinator -> gen_tool: generate_renovation_rendering 호출
project_coordinator -> edit_tool: edit_renovation_rendering 호출
